        {
          "text": "Dini Mungu inzizu alaru ezata kokoru Mungu Ata ma miliari eri ’di’i imvoanzi pi andrizu awuzi pie ocoko yini ma alia, azini ’bani i ma agei tezu e’yo nyakuni kazu eri ezazu ku.",
